      "text": "PHYSICS LAYER:\n  Maxwell's equations (1864) -> Hertz demonstrates EM waves (1887)\n  -> Marconi transatlantic (1901) -> Continuous wave (1906)\n  -> Vacuum tube amplification (de Forest Audion, 1907)\n  -> Commercial broadcasting (KDKA Pittsburgh, 1920)"
    },
